<h1><%= lang==='ro' ? 'Prezentare generală a școlilor' : 'School overview' %></h1>
<p class="subtitle"><%= lang==='ro'
  ? 'Vizualizare și filtrare doar — fără potrivire automată. Fiecare decizie de finanțare este evaluată separat, în funcție de situația reală a fiecărei școli.'
  : 'View and filter only — no automated matching. Each funding decision is evaluated case by case, against the real situation of each school.' %></p>

<div class="card">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0;border:none;"><%= lang==='ro' ? 'Filtre' : 'Filters' %></h2>
  <form method="GET" action="/partner">
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div>
        <label><%= lang==='ro'?'Bandă':'Band' %></label>
        <select name="band">
          <option value="">—</option>
          <% bands.forEach(b => { %><option value="<%= b.key %>" <%= query.band===b.key?'selected':'' %>><%= b.key %></option><% }) %>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label><%= lang==='ro'?'Ordinul 675':'Order 675' %></label>
        <select name="compliance">
          <option value="">—</option>
          <option value="compliant" <%= query.compliance==='compliant'?'selected':'' %>><%= t('compliant') %></option>
          <option value="gap" <%= query.compliance==='gap'?'selected':'' %>><%= lang==='ro'?'DECALAJ':'GAP' %></option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label><%= lang==='ro'?'Sortare':'Sort' %></label>
        <select name="sort">
          <option value="">—</option>
          <option value="name-asc" <%= query.sort==='name-asc'?'selected':'' %>><%= lang==='ro'?'Nume A-Z':'Name A-Z' %></option>
          <option value="D-asc" <%= query.sort==='D-asc'?'selected':'' %>>D ↑ (<%= lang==='ro'?'nevoie infrastructură':'infrastructure need' %>)</option>
          <option value="C-desc" <%= query.sort==='C-desc'?'selected':'' %>>C ↓ (<%= lang==='ro'?'capacitate mare':'high capacity' %>)</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:0.8rem;">
      <button class="btn btn-sm" type="submit"><%= lang==='ro'?'Aplică':'Apply' %></button>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" href="/partner"><%= lang==='ro'?'Resetează':'Reset' %></a>
    </div>
  </form>
</div>

<h2><%= lang==='ro' ? 'Școli' : 'Schools' %> (<%= filteredCount %>/<%= totalSchools %>)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th><%= lang==='ro'?'Școală':'School' %></th><th><%= lang==='ro'?'Teritoriu':'Territory' %></th><th><%= lang==='ro'?'Bandă':'Band' %></th><th><%= t('th_status') %></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th><%= lang==='ro'?'Ordinul 675':'Order 675' %></th></tr>
  <% rows.forEach(r => { %>
    <tr>
      <td><%= r.school.name %></td>
      <td><%= r.school.territory ? r.school.territory.name : '—' %></td>
      <td><%= r.school.enrolmentBand %></td>
      <td><% if (!r.cycle) { %><span class="badge"><%= lang==='ro'?'Fără date':'No data' %></span><% } else { %><span class="badge badge-<%= r.cycle.status.toLowerCase() %>"><%= STATUS_LABELS[r.cycle.status] %></span><% } %></td>
      <% ['A','B','C','D'].forEach(d => { %><td><%= r.domainScores && r.domainScores[d] !== null ? r.domainScores[d].toFixed(1) : '—' %></td><% }) %>
      <td><% if (r.deviceCompliance && r.networkCompliance) { %><span class="badge badge-<%= (r.deviceCompliance.compliant && r.networkCompliance.compliant) ? 'pass' : 'fail' %>"><%= (r.deviceCompliance.compliant && r.networkCompliance.compliant) ? t('ok') : (lang==='ro'?'DECALAJ':'GAP') %></span><% } else { %>—<% } %></td>
    </tr>
  <% }) %>
</table>
<p class="small" style="margin-top:1rem;"><%= lang==='ro'
  ? 'Pentru discuții privind o școală anume sau o propunere de finanțare, contactați Ministerul Educației și Cercetării — datele detaliate pe indicatori rămân la nivelul școlii și al Ministerului.'
  : 'To discuss a specific school or a funding proposal, contact the Ministry of Education and Research — detailed per-indicator data stays with the school and the Ministry.' %></p>
